DESCRIPTION:Join us every Wednesday for hands-on gardening projects at the 
	McGovern Centennial Gardens. From 8 a.m. to 11 a.m.\, come help with seaso
	nal tasks like planting\, weeding\, mulching\, and pruning. A great way to
	 connect with others and make a visible impact in the Park! \nNo experienc
	e needed. All ages are welcome. \nMeet at the Family Garden in McGovern Ce
	ntennial Gardens. \n Click here to sign up!\n\nhttps://hermannpark.org/eve
	nt/mcgovern-centennial-gardens-volunteer-day-12/\n\nFrom Hermann Park Cons
	ervancy
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/mcgovern-centennial-gardens-volunteer-day
	-12/
