SUMMARY:HARRA's Party in the Park
DTSTAMP:20260805T111658Z
DTSTART:20260808T070000Z
DESCRIPTION:Houston Party in the Park is back!\n\n\nJoin us on Saturday\, A
	ugust 8\, for the 2026 edition of HARRA’s Party in the Park—a free communi
	ty event for runners of all paces!\n\n\n Run\, walk\, connect\, and celebr
	ate Houston’s running community\n Free watermelon and refreshments\n Beer\
	n Live music\n Run club and organization tents\n\n\n Saturday\, August 8 |
	 7:00–10:00 AM\n Memorial Park—west of the Tennis Center\n\n\n Individual 
	RSVP\nPlease RSVP so we can plan enough refreshments for everyone.\n\n\n T
	ent Space Reservations\nRun clubs and organizations are invited to reserve
	 a space and showcase their group.\n\n\nHARRA running club membership is o
	nly $35 per year.\n\n\nRSVP and Learn More: linktr.ee/harraruns.\n\n\nTag 
	your running crew and join us for one of Houston’s biggest running communi
	ty celebrations!\n\nhttps://www.memorialparkconservancy.org/event/harras-p
	arty-in-the-park/\n\nFrom Memorial Park Conservancy
URL:https://www.memorialparkconservancy.org/event/harras-party-in-the-park/
LOCATION:Clay Family Eastern Glades\, 6500 Memorial Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 770
	07\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:memorial-park-conservancy
CATEGORIES:Memorial Park Conservancy
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT3H
END:VEVENT
